    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d47b003928870b79",
      "translationZh": "随着人们对 Jev 的最近兴趣，尤其是在开源和可本地执行的替代方案方面，我想分享我们在滑铁卢大学一直在构建的相关项目：ProgramAsWeights (PAW)。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84b1d545efcbb325",
      "translationZh": "这个想法很简单：用英文描述一个函数，编译一次，然后从 Python 调用它。生成的函数在您自己的 CPU 上运行，无需将每个输入发送到 API。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec296db7b6867a9c",
      "translationZh": "我们训练了一个更大的模型，以从英文函数描述生成 LoRA 适配器。该适配器专门化共享的 Qwen3 0.6B 解释器以完成任务。您可以保存多个编译好的函数并重复使用同一个基础模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "85e11b970e6a7447",
      "translationZh": "SDK 默认使用我们托管的编译器。下载编译后的程序和基础模型后，推理在本地运行且可离线工作。编译器的权重也已公开，供希望自行运行编译的人使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07267b81d9975cbd",
      "translationZh": "我用这个构建了一个课程网站助手，其中约 30 个小型神经程序通过普通决策树代码连接。一个函数决定哪个回答者应处理问题，周围的代码控制后续发生的事情。如果您好奇，这里是我的课程网站助手：https://yuntiandeng.com/teaching/spring2026/cs486-introduction-to-artificial-intelligence/#ask",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09b9f7dd19484bad",
      "translationZh": "你们中的一些人可能记得之前在这里发布的早期版本（ https://www.reddit.com/r/LocalLLaMA/comments/1sm9fmw/compile_english_function_descriptions_into_22mb/ ）。当时，人们要求发布编译器本身。其权重现在已经公开，随附解释其工作原理的论文。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f62aa5a97089aa3d",
      "translationZh": "编译器权重：https://huggingface.co/programasweights/paw-4b-qwen3-0.6b",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a41ee58a6d2155ed",
      "translationZh": "论文：https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.02512",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
